# Requests against a locally running API (`dotnet run --project src/ScrapGo.Core.Api`).
# Paste a GCIP ID token for project wrigley-cloud-prod into @token.
@host = http://localhost:5141
@token = paste-a-gcip-id-token

### Health (anonymous)
GET {{host}}/healthz

### The caller's own user record (provisions it on first call)
GET {{host}}/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### My organizations
GET {{host}}/api/organizations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create an organization (caller becomes OrganizationAdministrator)
POST {{host}}/api/organizations
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Acme Metals" }

### Permission catalog
GET {{host}}/api/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
